        1523,
        1163
      ],
      "category": "Text",
      "text": "WHEREAS, it is necessary to coordinate and provide for the development of computer systems which will improve agency operations, service levels and management information; and it is necessary to insure the timely and competitive acquisition of data processing goods and services; and it is necessary to coordinate systems which have common applicability to more than one agency or which require data collected or managed by another agency or more than one agency; and it is necessary that the City develop and maintain a coordinated strategy for the effective and efficient use of information systems and to insure that agency plans are consistent with this strategy.",
